{"case_id":"SMELL-015-N01","label":"negative","nodes":[{"node_id":"n01-rule","kind":"siu_rule","text":"Indicator FI-22 begins with a common invoice-anomaly score, then evaluates the jurisdiction branch before any SIU referral.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-siu-rule-n01","source_type":"siu_model_spec","document_version":"SIU-FI-v6","section":"Indicators / FI-22","jurisdiction":"multi_state","as_of":"2026-07-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n01-jurisdictions","kind":"jurisdiction_set","text":"FI-22 is deployed to Kentucky and Ohio homeowners claims.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-deployment-n01","source_type":"siu_deployment_map","document_version":"deploy-map-n01-v4","section":"State Rollout","jurisdiction":["KY","OH"],"as_of":"2026-07-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n01-branches","kind":"jurisdiction_branch","text":"For Kentucky, the workflow requires the Kentucky documentation check before referral. For Ohio, it requires the Ohio notice gate and records the state-specific reason code. Each branch has its own threshold and route.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-siu-branch-n01","source_type":"siu_workflow","document_version":"SIU-FI-v6","section":"Indicators / FI-22 / State Branches","jurisdiction":["KY","OH"],"as_of":"2026-07-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture","branch_status":"present"}},{"node_id":"n01-override","kind":"override","text":"The jurisdiction branch takes precedence over the common score whenever a state's applicability rule differs.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-siu-control-n01","source_type":"siu_rule_control","document_version":"SIU-FI-v6","section":"State Precedence","jurisdiction":["KY","OH"],"as_of":"2026-07-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n01-rule","target":"n01-jurisdictions","type":"deployed_to"},{"source":"n01-rule","target":"n01-branches","type":"branches_by"},{"source":"n01-branches","target":"n01-override","type":"takes_precedence_over"}],"expected":{"smell_id":"SMELL-015","label":"negative","required_evidence_roles":["shared_siu_rule","jurisdiction_set","branch_or_override_check"]}}
{"case_id":"SMELL-015-N02","label":"negative","nodes":[{"node_id":"n02-rule","kind":"siu_rule","text":"The common indicator FI-31 is a preliminary data-quality flag only. It creates no presumption of fraud and may be used for the same triage step in every listed jurisdiction.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-siu-rule-n02","source_type":"siu_model_spec","document_version":"SIU-FI-v3","section":"Indicators / FI-31","jurisdiction":"multi_state","as_of":"2026-05-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n02-jurisdictions","kind":"jurisdiction_set","text":"FI-31 is used in Oregon and Washington for the same non-dispositive triage step.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-deployment-n02","source_type":"siu_deployment_map","document_version":"deploy-map-n02-v1","section":"State Rollout","jurisdiction":["OR","WA"],"as_of":"2026-05-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n02-equivalence","kind":"jurisdictional_equivalence","text":"The supplied jurisdiction review found no difference for this limited triage use: both state overlays permit the same data-quality review, and neither permits FI-31 alone to route, deny, or delay a claim.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-jurisdiction-review-n02","source_type":"jurisdiction_matrix","document_version":"jurisdiction-matrix-n02-v1","section":"SIU Indicator Applicability / FI-31","jurisdiction":["OR","WA"],"as_of":"2026-05-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture","comparison_basis":"fixture_authority_notes"}},{"node_id":"n02-control","kind":"scope_control","text":"The common rule is explicitly limited to the equivalent data-quality triage step; jurisdiction-specific denial or referral decisions occur only after separate state gates.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-siu-control-n02","source_type":"siu_rule_control","document_version":"SIU-FI-v3","section":"Indicators / FI-31 / Scope","jurisdiction":["OR","WA"],"as_of":"2026-05-01","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}}],"edges":[{"source":